HUSSAINIYAT KI BAQA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
kE FATIMA S.A KI DUA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
<br>
1. GALE KO CHOOMKE ROTE THE SARWARE AALAM<br>
RASOOL NE BHI KIYA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
2. HARAM KE RONE SE PABANDIYAA'N HATAADE LAYEE'N<br>
kE INKE GHAM KI DAWA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
3. BANDHI KALAAYI TO AANKHOU SE KARTE HAIN MAATAM<br>
HARAM ME HOTA RAHA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
4. MILI REHAYI JO AHLE HARAM KO ZINDAA'N SE<br>
BAHEN NE PEHLE KIYA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
5. DHADAK RAHA HAI HAREK DIL SADAE MATAM SE<br>
HAR EK DIL ME BASA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
<br>
6. RAHEGA HASHR TALAK YA HUSSAIN ZINDABAAD<br>
RUKEGA YE NA RUKA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
7. NAMAAZE ISHQ PADHENGE HAMESHA AHLE AZA<br>
DILAAYE QURBE KHUDA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
8. YAZEED KO MILI ISSE SHIKAST HAR LAMHA<br>
USI KE GHAR ME HUA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
9. YE AISA GHAM HAI JO DIL KO SUKOON DETA HAI<br>
SABHI GHAMOU'N SE JUDA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
10. KISI KHUSHI KI HAMEIN AB KOI TALAASH NAHI<br>
KHUDA NE HUMKO DIYA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
11. NAMAZEIN USKI kisi haal rad nahi hoteen<br>
JO SHAKSH KARTA ADA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM<br>
<br>
12. SAKINA BIBI KI MAYYAT PE SAIF RORO KAR<br>
HARAM NE KHOOB KIYA HAI HUSSAIN KA MATAM